OL,3,GNEWSAVictorian villa could become
OL,4,A27-bed HMO
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Victorian villa could be converted
OL,7,Finto a house in multiple occupancy
OL,8,F(HMO) with accommodation for 27 people,
OL,9,Funder plans.
OL,11,FThe Hullywood Rooms hotel, in Park Row,
OL,12,FHull, was built in 1862 and previously
OL,13,Fused as a doctor's surgery.
OL,15,FA previous attempt to convert the
OL,16,Fbuilding into a 32-bed HMO was turned
OL,17,Fdown in 2023 after planning officers
OL,18,Fcriticised a proposed extension to the
OL,19,Fbuilding. A scaled-down application for
OL,20,F23 bedrooms was approved in January
OL,21,F2024, but not acted on.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
