OL,3,GNEWSAVictorian villa could become
OL,4,A27-bed HMO
OL,5,
OL,6,FTownglow Ltd, the applicant, said the
OL,7,Flatest proposal would "retain a viable
OL,8,Fuse" for the building and would not
OL,9,Frequire external changes.
